+//   <hidden locals " dNc", " dNa0", " dNa1", " dNs" declared in the scope>
+//   <callee evaluated into a temp, moved to " dNc">      ; the SNAPSHOT:
+//   <arg evaluated into a temp, moved to " dNa0">        ; callee and args are
+//   ...                                                  ; read NOW, not at exit
